      "description": "Everything you save, in one place you'll actually open.\n\nYou save things all day. A recipe from Instagram, a jacket from a shop you'll think about later, an article you meant to read, a video you sent yourself. Then it's gone, buried in a chat thread or a browser tab you closed weeks ago.\n\nView Later catches all of it and files it the moment you hit save.\n\nIT SORTS ITSELF\nRecipes, YouTube, Shopping, Articles, Screenshots, Instagram and TikTok each get their own list, filled automatically as you save. Anything that doesn't match lands in Unsorted. Turn off the lists you don't use.\n\nMAKE YOUR OWN LISTS\nA trip, a project, a gift list. Your lists start empty and fill however you like. Add tags, leave notes, and mark recipes as made it once you've cooked them.\n\nSET A REMINDER\nTomorrow, next week, or a date and time you pick. A notification brings the save back when you asked for it, instead of leaving you to remember on your own.\n\nSAVE FROM ANYWHERE\nTap share in Safari, Instagram, YouTube, TikTok or your camera roll. Two taps and it's in.\n\nFIND IT AGAIN\nSearch across titles, notes and tags. Tap a tag to see every save that carries it.\n\nA REAL IPAD APP\nThe full library laid out for the screen you're on, not a stretched phone.\n\nARCHIVE, DON'T DELETE\nClear things out without losing them.\n\nBUY IT ONCE\nOne payment and it's yours. No renewal, no tiers, no upgrade later.\n\nNO ACCOUNT\nNothing to sign up for, nothing to log into. There is no View Later account and no server holding your saves.\n\nYOUR ICLOUD\nSaves sync privately through your own iCloud, across your iPhone and iPad. Turn iCloud off and everything stays on your device.",
